# Prefer explicit

## Locale

- Pass `locale: Locale` as a prop — do not read locale from globals inside sections
- Resolve strings with `translate(value, locale)` at the call site
- Route locale comes from `parseRoute()`, not implicit Astro i18n folder routing (ADR-0006)

## Configuration

- Public site values: `astro:env/client` imports (`PUBLIC_*`)
- Secrets: `astro:env/server` in API routes and `src/lib/orbitype/` only
- `astro.config.ts` reads `process.env` directly — document why when adding vars

## Data flow

- Pages fetch; sections render props — no hidden fetches in components
- Section registry keys equal filenames — no alias map unless documented
- Cache tags and `maxAge` declared in `routeRules`, not inferred

## Errors

- Throw `OrbitypeError` with status and body text from SQL client
- Return real HTTP status codes from API routes (`400`, `404`, not generic `500` for validation)
- Unknown CMS slugs → `Astro.rewrite("/404")`, not silent redirect to home

Explicit code survives cloning, code review, and agent edits better than convention alone.
